  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TA Support to vaccine manufacturing and pharma in Ghana (Finance expert)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The contract is to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Provide technical support and advice to beneficiary institutions and the EU Delegation to Ghana in the preparation of budget estimates for contracts and other related activities and other relevant financial documents as part of contractual processes;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2. Assess the existing financial management systems of beneficiary institutions, identify the gaps and best practices and propose recommendations to the EU Delegation on a comprehensive framework for monitoring the contract during the period of implementation.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
